petrus-agenticus-core
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of the pure and SQLite-backed core layers of
Petrus Agenticus (petrus.agenticus) from Petrus
(https://github.com/henriquebastos/petrus), pinned under upstream/petrus
(see UPSTREAM.md at the repository root). It reproduces the observable
behaviour of that reference, and its test suite ports the reference's tests
and runs differential checks against it.

Files copied unmodified from the reference: test/conformance/catalog-
descriptor-v1.json and test/conformance/catalog-result-v1.json (upstream
tests/petrus/agenticus/conformance/).

